From 43adb6f1d7495fd439006ad7fe3a5947571bd1dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:31:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] apps: paper/ink static ongoing call

Squashed from:
- 0001-paper-ink-ongoing-call
- 0002-static-ongoing-call-presentation

Change-Id: Icc348cc1d1c03a5b544b294480a74bbfed51afef

DTMF keys are separate outlined tiles (2dp inset) instead of sharing doubled edges; audio-route rows have no edge at rest inside the outlined sheet, which keeps its native 28dp top corners; white letter tiles get a whole-pixel ink ring.

Call controls, panels and the avatar ring use whole-pixel 1dp edges (2px at 300dpi); checked buttons and active controls are one 2dp edge instead of a second inset ring; dashes are 3dp/2dp; inactive page dots are a round(density) ring inside the dot.
